  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure your place in a truly special boutique residence.\r\n\r\nFor those who appreciate considered architecture, refined interiors and effortless living, this exceptional Browns Bay home offers something genuinely distinctive. Designed by award-winning Matz Architects, the residence combines sophisticated design with a warm, inviting feel. The open-plan living and designer kitchen create an elegant space for both relaxed everyday living and entertaining, complemented by quality finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nWith Browns Bay village and the coastline moments away, the lifestyle is equally impressive. Enjoy your morning coffee, a walk along the beach or dinner at a local restaurant - all without going far from home.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n* Approximately 200m from Browns Bay Beach\r\n* Two generous bedrooms including master bedroom with en-suite\r\n* 2 bathrooms for added convenience with underfloor heating\r\n* Built-in lift for effortless accessibility \r\n* Elevated outlook across Browns Bay with shops, restaurants right on your doorstep quite literally\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium finishes and fittings\r\n* Pets allowed\r\n* Engineered oak flooring and high-efficiency heat pumps\r\n* High-speed embedded WiFi network\r\n* Secure and private single garage parking \r\n\r\nPerfect for the discerning professional, down-sizer or lock-up-and-leave buyer, this is more than simply a home - it is an opportunity to become part of a distinctive boutique residence in one of Browns Bay's most sought-after positions.\r\n\r\nContact David Park for more information today to arrange your private viewing. All conjunctional agents are welcome.\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35753",
